sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as React/Vite UI
    participant API as FastAPI API
    participant Service as DemoInvestigationService
    participant Registry as SQLite run registry
    participant Runner as WorkflowService
    participant Retrieval as retrieve_evidence
    participant Graph as LangGraph workflow
    participant Checkpoints as SQLite checkpoints

    User->>UI: Select demo case
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/investigations
    API->>Service: start(case_id)
    Service->>Registry: create pending run
    Service->>Runner: run(run_id, incident, data_root)
    Runner->>Retrieval: load ranked cited evidence
    Retrieval-->>Runner: RetrievedEvidence[]
    Runner->>Graph: invoke incident + evidence + run_id
    Graph->>Checkpoints: persist state by thread_id

    alt no human review required
        Graph-->>Runner: report_ready state
        Runner-->>Service: WorkflowRunResult
        Service->>Registry: mark completed
        Service-->>API: InvestigationResponse
        API-->>UI: completed report
    else human review required
        Graph-->>Runner: interrupted state
        Runner-->>Service: WorkflowRunResult
        Service->>Registry: mark awaiting_review
        Service-->>API: InvestigationResponse
        API-->>UI: review packet summary
        User->>UI: Approve or reject
        UI->>API: POST /api/v1/investigations/{run_id}/review
        API->>Service: review(run_id, approved)
        Service->>Runner: resume(run_id, approved)
        Runner->>Graph: Command(resume)
        Graph->>Checkpoints: update resumed state
        Graph-->>Runner: completed or rejected state
        Runner-->>Service: WorkflowRunResult
        Service->>Registry: mark completed or rejected
        Service-->>API: InvestigationResponse
        API-->>UI: final status
    end
